{"id":"9be36457b5d085f5","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-sequent-exchange.md","title":"Sequent Exchange","display":"df-sequent-exchange — Sequent Exchange","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-sequent-exchange","aliases":["72-df-sequent-exchange"],"display":"df-sequent-exchange — Sequent Exchange","depends_on":["[[72-df-exchange]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Chapter I, section 1.2.2, printed p.11, PDF p.23","source_statement_checked":true,"verification_status":"definition-contract-checked","proof_status":"local typed rule-relation or compatibility-alias construction checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-sequent-exchange"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-sequent-exchange</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-sequent-exchange — Sequent Exchange"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e18594e1037dd7cd\" href=\"?note=e18594e1037dd7cd\" title=\"72-df-exchange\">72-df-exchange</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Chapter I, section 1.2.2, printed p.11, PDF p.23"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local typed rule-relation or compatibility-alias construction checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Exchange}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{Exchange}_L\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Exchange}_R\">\\(\\operatorname{Exchange}_R\\)</span> are the two exchange inference relations of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e18594e1037dd7cd\" href=\"?note=e18594e1037dd7cd\" title=\"72-df-exchange\">72-df-exchange</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SeqExchange}\">\\(\\operatorname{SeqExchange}\\)</span> is the local compatibility name</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SeqExchange}\n\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Exchange}_L\\cup\\operatorname{Exchange}_R.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SeqExchange}\n\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Exchange}_L\\cup\\operatorname{Exchange}_R.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The bridge includes antecedent and succedent exchange.  When contexts are multisets, both are absorbed into context equality.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-exchange","status":"resolved","id":"e18594e1037dd7cd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-exchange]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-exchange","status":"resolved","id":"e18594e1037dd7cd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Exchange}_L$ and $\\operatorname{Exchange}_R$ are the two exchange inference relations of [[72-df-exchange]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Exchange}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Exchange}_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SeqExchange}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SeqExchange}\n\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Exchange}_L\\cup\\operatorname{Exchange}_R.","display":true}],"bytes":1067,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-55","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-sequent-exchange|df-sequent-exchange — Sequent Exchange]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-55","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-sequent-exchange|df-sequent-exchange — Sequent Exchange]]"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-188","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-sequent-exchange|72-df-sequent-exchange]]"}],"outgoing":["e18594e1037dd7cd"]}